5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know the total cost before we say yes. No surprises.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Travel time is the enemy. I need to see how long the trip takes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who pays for what? I need to check the billing structure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I need to know about the bathrooms and meal times. Sleep is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to understand how we spent time together last year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the travel is too long, the fun dies.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, exactly. I am looking into the ferry and train times.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, if the schedule is rigid, it feels like a prison.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, I agree. I am checking the inn mealtimes and rooms.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I am looking at how last year's days actually ran.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will check the pricing of offshore houses.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
