35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island house is 5,400 yen a head a night. Food is extra.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The ferry takes two days total. The train to the valley is only ninety minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last year, separate rooms cost 8,000 yen more for some. A whole house is one bill.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The island house has one bathroom for everyone. The water runs cold.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Last year, we barely saw each other. In a shared house, there is no privacy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Takumi, one bathroom? That sounds like a nightmare for five people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the train option saves us two days of travel. That is huge.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, if we rent a house, the bill is even. No hidden costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Asuka, but if the bathroom is bad, I will hate it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, I agree. I need space. The shared house year was too crowded.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,The all-in rate charges the same for everyone. That is fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The city has trains every few minutes. No planning needed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The valley inn includes meals. The city bed does not.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,The inn has fixed meal times. The city room has no timetable.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The city allows us to be alone if we want. The house does not.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I prefer the city. I can control my own spending.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The city is best. Short travel, easy movement.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The city is logical. Separate rooms, separate bills.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,The city gives me freedom. No fixed bath times.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,The city lets us be together or apart. It is balanced.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
